    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got home from work. You are exhausted from a long, hard day of scratching on things and knocking cups off of counters. You know the best way to relax are funny cat videos, so you launch your pc, but it's filled with MeowWare! You must clear the pesky pop ups as quick as possible so you can get to watching your favorite videos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start, you can select the difficulty from 5 to 30 in the main gamemode, the higher the level, the more pop ups you get, and the greater degree of diversity you will see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Popups are simple images and memes that have no effect or puzzle cleared, while others may have a puzzle that you need to complete to close out the pop up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear all the pop ups, the game will save your time so you can share your high scores with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you don't feel like clicking through hundreds of pop ups, you can relax and navigate through the desktop-like environment to see what is hidden in the folders and on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game continues development, be sure to check back for new updates and features!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got home from work. You are exhausted from a long, hard day of scratching on things and knocking cups off of counters. You know the best way to relax are funny cat videos, so you launch your pc, but it's filled with MeowWare! You must clear the pesky pop ups as quick as possible so you can get to watching your favorite videos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start, you can select the difficulty from 5 to 30 in the main gamemode, the higher the level, the more pop ups you get, and the greater degree of diversity you will see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Popups are simple images and memes that have no effect or puzzle cleared, while others may have a puzzle that you need to complete to close out the pop up.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear all the pop ups, the game will save your time so you can share your high scores with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you don't feel like clicking through hundreds of pop ups, you can relax and navigate through the desktop-like environment to see what is hidden in the folders and on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game continues development, be sure to check back for new updates and features!</p>",
    "short_description": "A puzzle based clicker time attack game with nostalgic 1990's computer themes and cat culture. Click, type, and navigate through a litany of puzzles and memes to clear all the pop ups on screen!",
